Package: coord.serial
Title: Serial Coordinate System for ggplot2
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Daniel", "Wells", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "daniel.wells@example.com")
Description: A ggplot2 extension that provides a serial coordinate system
    for creating manhattan plots, time-series blocks, and other continuous
    visualisations of grouped serial data. Maps nested positions to a
    continuous axis using the grammar of graphics, without requiring manual
    data preprocessing.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends:
    R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports:
    ggplot2 (>= 3.0.0),
    rlang
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
LazyData: true
